Hi Guilia,

The .cov format corresponds to the Bismark coverage format <https://support.illumina.com/help/BaseSpace_App_MethylSeq_help/Content/Vault/Informatics/Sequencing_Analysis/Apps/swSEQ_mAPP_MethylSeq_Bismark_Coverage.htm>, which is supported by the `bismarkCoverage` pipeline.
You should be able to load the file as is by setting the pipeline argument of the methRead function to 'bismarkCoverage'.

Best,
Alex

